Source landscape is dominated by official sanctions/rights records, UN and NGO accountability documents, and a smaller set of academic and reporting leads. For 2023, the strongest discovery clusters are protest-crackdown accountability, execution policy, patronage/networked wealth around the Supreme Leader’s office, and Khamenei’s own public statements and appointments. I found enough distinct leads to exceed the minimum, including some metadata-only and paywalled candidates that should be kept for later inspection.

